  "bodyHash": "2a7315893f7bb496",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">需要 Geckolib</span></a></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/CoR_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1035\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>《符文之地生物》是一个旨在将符文宇宙带入 Minecraft 的模组</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">生物：</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/POROS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"241\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">魄罗</span></strong>：可以用饼干驯服，并可以装备武器和头盔。生成于雪原生物群系。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">传说魄罗</span></strong>：给普通魄罗一个铁砧，它会变成传说魄罗。每天可以修复一次物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">掠夺魄罗</span></strong>：给普通魄罗一颗海洋之心，它会变成掠夺魄罗。会向敌人射击。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>魄罗机器人</strong></span>：给普通魄罗一个箱子，它会变成魄罗机器人。它作为一个移动的箱子工作，可以给它一个发射器来向玩家投掷药水，或者给它一个工作台或熔炉以添加相应功能。（Shift+右键点击使其坐下）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">升华魄罗</span></strong>：给普通魄罗一个金块，它会变成升华魄罗。它可以与猪灵交易，并用一个金锭为玩家提供一个随机增益效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/silverwings.png\" alt=\"Silverwings\" width=\"665\" height=\"300\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>银翼</strong></span>：飞行坐骑，可以用生肉驯服，用熟鱼繁殖。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/Naafiri.png\" alt=\"Naafiri\" width=\"535\" height=\"331\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>娜芙丽</strong></span>：给驯服的狼一把娜芙丽匕首，会将其转化为娜芙丽。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">特殊物品：</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/SPECIAL_ITEMS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"241\"><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">鱼骨火箭筒</span></strong>：一种火箭发射器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">沙裂盾</span></strong>：按住 Shift 时右键点击可发射投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">阿特拉斯拳套</span></strong>：右键点击蓄力，再次右键点击可将玩家向前击飞。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">触须指南针</span></strong>：指向 12 格半径内最近的神古碎片。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">费德提克的鸟笼</span></strong>：Shift + 鼠标中键发射治疗玩家的投射物。</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>暗黑圣杯武器</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">暗黑圣杯武器可以在名为“暗黑圣杯基座”的结构中制作，这些结构位于下界 y=50 的高度。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/NicolasIannello/img/blob/main/structure.png\" alt=\"\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/structure.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"379\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">拉斯特</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">：穿透固体物体并变身为拉斯特。（物品：下界疣/铁锄/末影之眼）。<br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/rhaast recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"632\" height=\"176\"><br><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">娜芙丽</span></strong>：将狼转化为娜芙丽。（物品：骨块/木剑/凋灵骷髅头颅）。<br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/naafiri_recipe.png\" alt=\"naafiri recipe\" width=\"641\" height=\"219\"><br>要将暗黑圣杯武器升级到更高伤害，你需要在两侧放置两把武器。<br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/rhaast upgrade.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"632\" height=\"196\"></span></span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>敌对生物</strong></span>：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">雷克赛</span></strong>：可以在沙漠中使用钻机召唤。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/reksai.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"442\" height=\"441\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">虚空巢虫·沙裂者</span></strong>：生成于沙漠中的虚空洞穴里。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>虚空巢虫幼崽</strong>:</span> 生成于沙漠中。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>费德提克</strong></span>：必须在夜间召唤。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/fiddlesticks.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"375\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>费德提克仪式</strong></span>：<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">必须在夜间进行，盔甲架需要：</span></span><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">稻草人头盔 /&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">稻草人胸甲 / 铁护腿 / 链靴</span></span>。<br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/fiddle_ritual.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"391\"><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicolasIannello/img/main/recipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1102\" height=\"1180\"></p>\n</div>",
